@0    = ~Male! Fetch me water. My throat is parched.~
@1    = ~Sure thing - um, yes, mistress.~
@2    = ~No mutterings? No contradiction? It is good to see a male who knows his place. Perhaps you will go far.~
@3    = ~You know what? You can stop glaring at me now. It's putting me off.~
@4    = ~Pfah! What thoughts could you possibly have that my gaze would disrupt? Why, I would have you flogged where you stand were you not...~
@5    = ~...a lousy low-born surfacer?~
@6    = ~At least you have some idea of your state, lowly one.~
@7    = ~This surfacer's done a lot more damage than you give him credit for. So leave it, or you'll be sorry.~
@8    = ~Are you threatening me?~
@9    = ~Ha! As though one such as you could understand the things I have seen...the things I have done!~
@10   = ~We'll be out of here soon enough. Then we'll see who's understanding what.~
